Package: argon-control-center
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: wendelmax <https://github.com/wendelmax>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/wendelmax/argon-config-rs
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1, libgl1, libegl1, libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0 | libx11-6, udev
Recommends: pkexec | policykit-1, i2c-tools, gpiod
Suggests: raspi-utils
Description: Raspberry Pi & Argon40 hardware control center
 Desktop app to monitor and configure a Raspberry Pi in an Argon40 case:
 live telemetry, fan curve editor, board-aware overclocking (Pi 3/4/5),
 config.txt hardware toggles, GPIO logic analyzer, serial/I2C console and
 argononed service control. English and Brazilian Portuguese UI.
 .
 Installs udev rules and the i2c/gpio groups so members get hardware access
 without setuid binaries.
